*NAME MIXED
*CALL SETFTN:ONE,LONG
*PUNCH
*FULL
*ALGOL
                                             04 ИЮЛ 24 23.45
A L G O L - Г Д P
    (7.01.82)

     1.     ′COMMENT′ MIXED RELATIONS, BY-NAME FOR ELEMENTS, AN ELEMENT OF A
     2.       DYNAMIC ARRAY AS A PARAMETER BY NAME;
     3.     ′BEGIN′ ′INTEGER′ I, J, N; ′REAL′ X; ′BOOLEAN′ B;
     4.       ′PROCEDURE′ Q(Z); ′REAL′ Z; Z := Z + 1;
     5.       ′PROCEDURE′ R(V, W); ′INTEGER′ V, W;
     6.       ′BEGIN′ ′FOR′ V := W ′DO′ PRINT(V);
     7.         ′FOR′ V := W ′STEP′ W ′UNTIL′ 3 * W ′DO′ PRINT(V)
     8.       ′END′;
     9.       I := 1; J := 2; X := 1.5; N := 3;
    10.       B := I ′NOTEQUAL′ X; PRINT(B);
    11.       B := J ′NOTEQUAL′ 2.0; PRINT(B);
    12.       ′IF′ I ′GE′ X ′THEN′ PRINT(1) ′ELSE′ PRINT(2);
    13.       ′IF′ J ′GE′ X ′THEN′ PRINT(3) ′ELSE′ PRINT(4);
    14.       ′IF′ I ′NOTEQUAL′ X ′THEN′ PRINT(5) ′ELSE′ PRINT(6);
    15.       R(I, J);
    16.       ′BEGIN′ ′ARRAY′ A[1:N];
    17.         A[1] := 7; Q(A[1]); PRINT(A[1])
    18.       ′END′
    19.     ′END′
    20.     ′EOP′

